This workspace doesn't contain Tailwind CSS — it's `oxide`, a Rust code-index/retrieval engine (src/context.rs, src/retrieval.rs, etc.). There's no `corePlugins` config handling anywhere to extend; the only "plugins" matches are in an eval fixture's node_modules. The `corePlugins: { only: [...] }` change belongs in the tailwindcss repo, not this one — say the word if you want me pointed at that checkout and I'll implement it there.

